{
  "_comment": "EMBEDDED ARCHON settings (template v1, 2026-10-28). Loaded because the lane cwd is this persona folder. Project_Aion/.claude/settings.json does NOT load for this lane. Keep hook paths ABSOLUTE. autoMemoryDirectory is REQUIRED: auto-memory follows the git root, so without it the lane shares Jarvis memory.",
  "_permissions_comment": [
    "MCP tools carry no allow rule at user level, so every mcp__* call falls through to auto",
    "adjudication by a classifier model. On 2026-08-13/14 that classifier (claude-sonnet-5[1m])",
    "was unavailable for two days and EVERY browser call was refused before reaching Chrome \u2014",
    "not an auth failure, not a Chrome failure, a gating failure. That blocked llms.txt and the",
    "Testing doc, which in turn blocked proving the Starfish mirror is complete.",
    "",
    "Explicit allow rules bypass the classifier, so a classifier outage can no longer take",
    "this lane's browser, memory or task tools offline. Both forms are listed deliberately: the",
    "server-level rule (mcp__server) is the concise form, and the fully-qualified tool names are",
    "the guaranteed-supported form, so the allowlist holds even if server-level matching is not",
    "honored by this Claude Code version."
  ],
  "permissions": {
